admin/
├── admin_dashboard.php
│   - Description: This file represents the dashboard interface for the admin .
│   - Functionality: Displays summary information and links to various administrative tasks.
├── manage_account.php
│   - Description: Interface for creating accounts , updating account , resetting passwords,  by the admin.
│   - Functionality: Allows the admin to create new accounts for managers and ticket officers.

├── reset_password.php
│   - Description: Interface for resetting passwords by the admin.
│   - Functionality: Enables the admin to reset passwords for users who have forgotten or lost them.

├── update_account.php
│   - Description: Interface for updating account information by the admin.
│   - Functionality: Allows the admin to modify or change account details for managers and ticket officers.

├── post_notice_news.php
│   - Description: Interface for posting notices and news by the admin.
│   - Functionality: Enables the admin to post relevant notices and news for users.

└── view_comments.php
    - Description: Interface for viewing comments by the admin.
    - Functionality: Provides access to user comments for the admin to review and respond.
manager/
│
├── manager_dashboard.php
│   - Description: This file represents the dashboard interface for the manager user.
│   - Functionality: Displays summary information and links to various tasks.

├── generate_report.php
│   - Description: Interface for generating customized reports for the manager user.
│   - Functionality: Allows the manager to generate reports on work range and system usage status.

├── cancel_reserved_ticket.php
│   - Description: Interface for canceling reserved tickets by the manager user.
│   - Functionality: Enables the manager to cancel tickets after passengers have boarded the bus.

├── update_passenger_data.php
│   - Description: Interface for updating passenger data by the manager user.
│   - Functionality: Allows the manager to update passenger information as needed.

├── view_passenger_data.php
│   - Description: Interface for viewing passenger data by the manager user.
│   - Functionality: Provides the manager with access to view passenger information and ensure proper form filling.

├── postpone_reservation.php
│   - Description: Interface for postponing reserved tickets by the manager user.
│   - Functionality: Allows the manager to postpone tickets if passengers encounter unexpected circumstances.

└── view_comments.php
    - Description: Interface for viewing comments by the manager user.
    - Functionality: Displays comments left by users regarding the organization's services and allows the manager to respond.

ticket_officer/
│
├── ticket_officer_dashboard.php
│   - Description: Dashboard interface for ticket officers.
│   - Functionality: Displays summary information and links to ticket officer tasks.

├── view_passenger_data.php
│   - Description: Interface for viewing passenger data by ticket officers.
│   - Functionality: Allows ticket officers to access and view passenger information.

├── cancel_reserved_ticket.php
│   - Description: Interface for canceling reserved tickets by ticket officers.
│   - Functionality: Allows ticket officers to cancel tickets to prevent redundancy in the system.

├── confirm_reservation.php
│   - Description: Interface for confirming ticket reservations by ticket officers.
│   - Functionality: Allows ticket officers to confirm ticket reservations requested by passengers.

└── assign_bus.php
    - Description: Interface for assigning buses to users for reservation by ticket officers.
    - Functionality: Enables ticket officers to allocate buses to users for reservation.
passenger/
│
├── passenger_dashboard.php
│   - Description: Dashboard interface for passengers.
│   - Functionality: Displays summary information and links to passenger tasks.

├── view_payment_status.php
│   - Description: Interface for viewing payment status by passengers.
│   - Functionality: Allows passengers to check the status of their ticket payment.

├── give_comment.php
│   - Description: Interface for passengers to give feedback/comments.
│   - Functionality: Allows passengers to provide feedback about the organization's services.

├── reserve_ticket.php
│   - Description: Interface for passengers to reserve tickets.
│   - Functionality: Allows passengers to reserve tickets for bus journeys.

├── view_route_information.php
│   - Description: Interface for viewing route information by passengers.
│   - Functionality: Provides passengers with information about bus routes.

├── view_ticket_availability.php
│   - Description: Interface for viewing ticket availability by passengers.
│   - Functionality: Allows passengers to check the availability of tickets for desired travel dates and routes.

├── view_seat_availability.php
│   - Description: Interface for viewing seat availability by passengers.
│   - Functionality: Allows passengers to check the availability of seats on buses.

├── create_account.php
│   - Description: Interface for creating accounts by passengers.
│   - Functionality: Allows passengers to create accounts within the system.

└── make_payment.php
    - Description: Interface for making payments by passengers.
    - Functionality: Allows passengers to make payments securely for ticket reservations.
includes/
│
├── header.php
│   - Description: Common header file included in all pages.
│   - Functionality: Contains the header section of the HTML document.

├── footer.php
│   - Description: Common footer file included in all pages.
│   - Functionality: Contains the footer section of the HTML document.

└── db_connection.php
    - Description: File for establishing database connection.
    - Functionality: Contains code to connect to the database and provides connection object for database operations.
css/
│
└── style.css
    - Description: Cascading Style Sheets (CSS) file.
    - Functionality: Contains styling rules to define the appearance and layout of HTML elements.
js/
│
└── script.js
    - Description: JavaScript (JS) file.
    - Functionality: Contains client-side scripting code to add interactivity and behavior to web pages.
images/
│
└── (Directory containing image files)
    - Description: Directory containing image files used in the project, such as logos, icons, etc.
index.php
- Description: Main entry point of the application.
- Functionality: Redirects users to the appropriate login page based on their role (manager, admin, ticket officer, or passenger).

login.php
- Description: Login page for user authentication.
- Functionality: Allows users to log in using their credentials and grants access based on their role.

logout.php
- Description: Logout functionality.
- Functionality: Logs users out of the system and redirects them to the login page.
